  "id": "environmental-attitudes",
  "term": "environmental attitudes",
  "definition": "Environmental attitudes are a person’s relatively lasting evaluations and concerns about the physical environment. They involve cognitive, emotional, motivational, perceptual, and behavioral orientations toward environmental issues and are used as an indicator of behaviors that may help or harm environmental quality.",
